{"kind": "weekly", "period": "2026-W33", "prepared_on": "2026-08-15", "html": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,'PingFang TC','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;color:#16213e;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#1a2b4a;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;padding-left:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\">📅 本週 AI 新聞回顧 · 2026-08-10 ～ 2026-08-14</div>\n<div style=\"background:#e8f4fb;border-left:5px solid #3f97c9;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#3f97c9;font-weight:800;\">1.</span> OpenAI and Anthropic in price war as Chinese AI rivals gain ground<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#2b7fb0;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">美國AI大廠掀起降價戰,應對中國AI對手崛起</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">US AI labs are releasing cheaper models as Chinese rivals challenge their dominance and trillion-dollar ambitions.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">美國AI大廠推出更便宜的模型應戰,因中國AI對手的崛起正衝擊其兆美元級的市場野心。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Ars Technica</b> · <a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/ai/2026/08/openai-and-anthropic-in-price-war-as-chinese-ai-rivals-gain-ground/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#f2f6e8;border-left:5px solid #88a83f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#88a83f;font-weight:800;\">2.</span> Introducing Gemini 3.7 Flash<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6e8c28;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">模型</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Google發布Gemini 3.7 Flash,價格砍半</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Google unveiled Gemini 3.7 Flash, its strongest coding and agent development model yet, with improved software engineering and reasoning capabilities.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Google推出號稱最強大的程式撰寫與代理人開發模型Gemini 3.7 Flash,軟體工程與推理能力進一步提升,且每百萬token價格僅前代一半。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Google DeepMind</b> · <a href=\"https://deepmind.google/blog/introducing-gemini-3-7-flash/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#f9edf6;border-left:5px solid #c56bb0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#c56bb0;font-weight:800;\">3.</span> Government Systems Become a Live Testing Ground for AI Agent Attacks<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b04b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">政府系統淪AI Agent攻擊實戰場</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">A Financial Times report revealed an autonomous AI attack framework built on Hermes and OpenClaw that independently researched vulnerabilities and executed a four-day, 12-wave intrusion against an Asian government agency.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">英國金融時報揭露一套建立在Hermes與OpenClaw之上的自主式AI攻擊框架,針對亞洲某國政府機關發動長達四天、共12波的入侵行動,並自主研究新漏洞。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/178135\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#eef4ff;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#5b8def;font-weight:800;\">4.</span> LiteLLM Supply Chain Attack May Have Hit Over 2,500 Organizations<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#3b6cf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">LiteLLM供應鏈攻擊恐波及逾2,500家企業組織</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Security firm CloudSEK found the March LiteLLM supply chain attack may affect more than 2,500 enterprises and 434,000 CI/CD workflows, making it one of 2026's largest AI supply chain incidents.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">資安公司CloudSEK調查發現,今年3月的LiteLLM供應鏈攻擊可能波及全球逾2,500家企業與約43.4萬個CI/CD工作流程,是今年最大規模的AI供應鏈安全事件之一。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/178138\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#ecf7ef;border-left:5px solid #4caf72;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#4caf72;font-weight:800;\">5.</span> Vulnerability giving attackers full control of Macs is under active exploitation<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#1e9e57;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Mac重大漏洞遭駭客積極利用,可完全控制裝置</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">A screen-sharing bug lets remote attackers log into Macs without a password, giving them full control, and it's already being actively exploited in the wild.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">一項螢幕分享漏洞讓遠端攻擊者無需密碼即可登入Mac並取得完整控制權,目前已遭到實際攻擊利用。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Ars Technica</b> · <a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/security/2026/08/vulnerability-giving-attackers-full-control-of-macs-is-under-active-exploitation/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#f1ecfb;border-left:5px solid #8a6bd8;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#8a6bd8;font-weight:800;\">6.</span> Mark Zuckerberg's AI Manifesto Is 6,500 Words—and Barely Says Anything<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6b3bf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">祖克柏6,500字AI宣言,實則語焉不詳</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Meta released Glimmer, an open-weight model anyone can run locally, alongside a lengthy manifesto from Mark Zuckerberg about AI being \"for everyone\" — but critics say the letter says little of substance.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Meta本週發布開放權重模型Glimmer,並附上祖克柏一封長達6,500字、宣稱「AI屬於每個人」的宣言,但外界批評內容空泛、實質不多。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Wired</b> · <a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/mark-zuckerbergs-ai-manifesto-is-6500-words-and-barely-says-anything/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#e8f6f5;border-left:5px solid #2bb0a6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#2bb0a6;font-weight:800;\">7.</span> More AI Agents Isn't Always More Efficient, Anthropic Study Finds<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#0f9b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">研究</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">AI代理不是越多越有效率,協作恐出現資源爭用與相互封鎖</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Anthropic published results from testing multiple AI agents collaborating on a shared codebase, finding that adding more agents can cause conflicts, resource contention, and even agents blocking each other's tasks.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Anthropic公開多代理AI協作實驗結果,顯示在共用程式庫時增加代理數量不一定提升效率,反而可能導致衝突、資源爭用,甚至互相阻擋任務。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/178146\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#fbf3e3;border-left:5px solid #d99b3f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#d99b3f;font-weight:800;\">8.</span> As AI safety concerns mount, three pioneers make the case for staying open<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b9791f;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">AI安全疑慮升溫,三位先驅為開源辯護</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">At the Ai4 conference, Geoffrey Hinton, Fei-Fei Li, and Andrew Ng debated AI regulation and open-source access as safety concerns mount and China advances in the field.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">在Ai4大會上,Geoffrey Hinton、李飛飛與吳恩達就AI法規、開源近用權展開辯論,議題聚焦於安全疑慮升溫下美國該如何應對中國的技術進展。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/08/12/as-ai-safety-concerns-mount-three-pioneers-make-the-case-for-staying-open/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#fdeef0;border-left:5px solid #e0738a;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#e0738a;font-weight:800;\">9.</span> You can now turn off Google Gemini's visible watermarks<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#d83a5e;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Google Gemini新增功能,可關閉AI生成內容的可見浮水印</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Google now lets users toggle off the visible \"sparkle\" watermark on images, videos, and music made with Gemini and Flow, though invisible watermarks used for identification remain unaffected.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Google現在讓使用者可以關閉Gemini與Flow生成的圖片、影片及音樂上的可見「星火」浮水印,但用於辨識的隱形浮水印不受影響。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/tech/980416/google-gemini-ai-watermarks-removal\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#edeefb;border-left:5px solid #6b72d6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#6b72d6;font-weight:800;\">10.</span> Apple trained its own AI model for China with help from Alibaba<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#5159c9;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">蘋果與阿里巴巴合作,為中國市場打造專屬AI模型</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Apple reportedly trained a custom large language model for the China market in partnership with Alibaba, a rare cross-border collaboration amid growing US-China tech tensions.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">蘋果據傳與中國科技巨頭阿里巴巴合作,為中國市場開發專屬的大型語言模型,這項跨國合作在美中科技關係緊張之際顯得格外罕見。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/980160/apple-intelligence-china-custom-ai-model-alibaba\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:11.5px;color:#9aa1ad;padding-top:10px;\">由 AI News Digest 從各家 RSS 自動挑選、翻譯並寄送</div>\n</div>\n"}